RCA Agent database migrations
=============================

This directory contains Alembic migrations for the RCA Agent MySQL schema.

The schema stores runtime configuration and investigation data, including:

- Applications;
- Connections;
- Application diagnostic tools;
- semantic dependencies and dependency diagnostic bindings;
- investigations and collected evidence;
- optional LLM request/response history;
- authentication/RBAC users and sessions.

Apply the current schema with:

    cd backend
    alembic upgrade head

The Kubernetes Helm deployment runs `alembic upgrade head` in an initContainer before the API starts.

Do not edit an already-applied migration in a released deployment. Create a new Alembic revision for schema changes.

For upgrade behavior and compatibility guidance, see:

    ../../docs/UPGRADES.md
